{"ID":"20240513083231-5qbzbg9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083231-5qbzbg9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083231-5qbzbg9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134324-bw2vxy6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134328-kn8tslo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134324-bw2vxy6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:321,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:321\u0026#125;","title":"142","type":"doc","updated":"20240514125201"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513134324-bw2vxy6","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 891px;","id":"20240513134324-bw2vxy6","updated":"20240514125201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：復診"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"117-05 S, T"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"58歲，高大稍胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080502"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人因下肢水腫，肺積水來診"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 水腫好轉中"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（昨天是足腫到陰陵泉下一寸處，再腫上去至膝(為陰之極)就是死症了，男怕足腫，一定要治療及時，明天是週末了，故今天多針一次，怕有週末病情加重就麻煩了。現在水腫是陰陵泉下一寸半）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 小便增加。四逆冷漸少"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：\n2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"進步中"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三皇穴，複溜，水泉，照海，開四關，巨闕，關元，公孫，內關"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 巨闕，關元，公孫，內關治心，病人因心陽弱不制肺金而引起水腫，故用治心臟的幾個大穴。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 足三里治胃制水同時開胃口，因為病人胃口不是很好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 治水的穴位當然一定要用，故用三皇穴，復溜，水泉，照海。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240513134328-kn8tslo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513134328-kn8tslo"}}]}